#39003
A chilled morgue~
Necromancers study death and disease.  To this end, they often require fresh
and sometimes not so fresh corpses.  In here, there is a collection of
cadavers in various stages of decay, along with many vials of evil looking
and smelling liquids.  A neophyte necromancer is here, selling some tools of
the trade.
~
