#39010
A spiral stairwell~
You are in a narrow stone shaft, wound about with a tight spiral staircase.
Each step is smaller than your foot, uneven and worn down by the passage of
many feet.  Above your head is a trap door leading into the Samsera Mortuary,
and from below your feet rises a dry, musty odor.
~
