#39011
A darkened crypt~
You are in a dusty crypt.  Around you, stone sarcophagi stand silent, their
contents long since turned to dust.  Footprints in the dust show you are not
the first to stand here, and the tops of several sarcophagi have papers and
other miscellaneous items scattered across them.  From a spiral staircase
near the west wall, a faint breeze of fresher air drifts past you into a
forbidding doorway to the east.
~
