#39013
A tunnel's end~
You are at the northern end of a stone tunnel.  The tunnel leads off into
darkness to the south, while set in the east and west walls are doors of
an age darkened wood.  On the northern wall, a finely engraved image of
Baalzebub, Lord of Maladomini, the Seventh Plane of Hell, stares out.
~
