#39014
A workshop~
You are standing in the workshop of the Wong brothers.  These brothers long
ago forsook the light of day to work in the cool darkness, studying the magic
of death and decay.  They are now masters in the creation of undead creatures
of all sorts, being most well known for their instrumental part in Plawev's
successes in Krynn.
~
