#39016
A peaceful chamber~
You are in a round stone chamber.  Around the edge of the chamber, the floor
is raised to form a circular bench, with cushions scattered about to provide
comfort.  In the ceiling, two narrow shafts provide a little ventilation and
light, though they are far too small to travel through.
~
